    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$(3,3),(6,6),(9,9),(12,12), \\in R$.\r\n\r\n$R$ isnot symmetricas (6,12)$\\notin R$ but (12,6)$\\in R$ $R$ is transitive as the only pair which needs verification is (3,6) and (6,12)$\\in R$.\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\Rightarrow \\quad(3,12) \\in R\r\n\r\n$$"
